OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway van fire leads to
OL,4,Awarnings of delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers have been warned to expect
OL,7,Fdelays after diversions were put in
OL,8,Fplace following a van fire on the M26
OL,9,Fin Kent, near the M25 junction.
OL,11,FNational Highways South East said the
OL,12,Fwestbound M26 carriageway was closed
OL,13,Fbecause of the blaze, between junction
OL,14,F3 for the M20 and junction 2A for
OL,15,FTonbridge, the M25 and the A21, just
OL,16,Fbefore 08:00 BST.
OL,18,FOne eastbound lane was closed because
OL,19,Fof smoke crossing the carriageway and
OL,20,Ffirefighters were sent to the scene,
OL,21,Fofficials said on social media.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
