OL,3,GNEWSAMotorway van fire leads to
OL,4,Awarnings of delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Fire and Rescue Service (KFRS)
OL,7,Fsaid they were called to reports of a
OL,8,Fvan on fire and crews in two fire
OL,9,Fengines put out the flames with a hose
OL,10,Freel jet.
